--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CopyPasta is a Windows port of Clipy, a macOS clipboard manager by the Clipy
Project, which is itself derived from ClipMenu by Naotaka Morimoto. Both are MIT
licensed, and their notices are reproduced in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which must
ship alongside this file.

CopyPasta's icons are original work and are covered by the licence above. Clipy's
own icons are copyrighted separately by their authors, are not covered by its MIT
grant, and are not used here.
